@baseUrl = https://localhost:7284

### 1) Public: anyone can view products → expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### 2) Delete WITHOUT a token → expect 401
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/999

### 3) Login with a WRONG password → expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "wrong" }

### 4) Login with the RIGHT password → expect 200 + token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "YOUR_REAL_PASSWORD" }

### 5) Delete WITH the token → expect 404 (auth passed; product 999 doesn't exist)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/999
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
### 6) Register a new customer → expect 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Ravi Kumar", "email": "ravi@test3.com", "password": "Password1", "confirmPassword": "Password1" }

### 7) Same email again → expect 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Ravi Again", "email": "RAVI@test.com ", "password": "Password1", "confirmPassword": "Password1" }

### 8) Bad data → expect 400 with an error list
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "", "email": "notanemail", "password": "123", "confirmPassword": "999" }
### Register my admin account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Balaji M", "email": "balajim03041996@gmail.com", "password": "onlineStore9822", "confirmPassword": "onlineStore9822" }
### 9) Login with a DB user → expect 200 + token
# @name dblogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "balajim03041996@gmail.com", "password": "onlineStore9822" }

### 10) Wrong password → expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "balajim03041996@gmail.com", "password": "wrong12345" }

### 11) Admin delete with the DB token → expect 404 (allowed; product 999 doesn't exist)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/999
Authorization: Bearer {{dblogin.response.body.$.token}}

